{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "65061605-47c2-8c54-a4e7-49188552a48f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T13:00:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nelson M. Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing, this is Walter. Thanks for holding, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Hello? [pause] Hm. Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry, I thought I got cut off. There was this long pause after the recording and I figured it hung up on me. Basically I'm calling about registering to vote."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine, that little gap happens when the call gets routed over. You're through to me. Are you looking to register yourself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:56:53-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it's for my dad. I'm calling for him, he's in his seventies. Basically he just moved, like three weeks ago, and he's still on the old registration. I don't know if he has to do the whole thing over again or just change something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Did he move within Newport, or from another city or town?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, from Middletown. So, different town. Basically he was on Middletown's list and now he's in Newport."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, then he'll need to submit a new registration with his Newport address. It replaces the old one, so he doesn't have to cancel anything in Middletown. He can do it online through the state's voter system, or fill out a paper form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online through the state. So not through you guys? Not on the city site?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:42-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The online one is run by the state, yes. But you can also come by City Hall, pick up a form, or we can mail one out to him."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:57:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And does he need like a license? Because he gave up his license last year. Basically he just has the state ID thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:01-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A state ID works fine. The form asks for an ID number, and if he has a license or state ID number, he'd use that. If he has neither, there's another option with the last four of his Social."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the last four. Got it. Wait, so, is it the ID number or the Social? Which one goes first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The ID number, if he has one. The Social is only a backup if he doesn't. Since he has the state ID, he'd just use that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, ID number. Good. Now what's the deadline? Is there a cutoff? I know there's one before elections but I don't know how it works, like is it the same for every election?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a cutoff before each election, and it's generally about a month ahead. It can differ a little depending on the election, so I'd check the date for whichever one he's planning to vote in. Is there a particular one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:58:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, not sure. Basically whatever's next. Is there one coming up soon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:59:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not this week, I can tell you that. If you give me a call after the holiday, we can look at the calendar together. Either way, if he registers now, he's set well ahead of any deadline."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:59:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. So if he does it now, he doesn't have to worry about the date at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Once it's processed, he'll get a card in the mail confirming his Newport registration."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:59:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, wait, the card, that's in the mail, and it comes from the state or from you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:59:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It usually comes from the local board, so from us here. A couple of weeks is typical."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:59:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I think I got it. Online, state ID number, wait for the card. I'll tell him. I might still call back about the date, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:59:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, anytime. We're here until the end of the day, and then closed tomorrow for the holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:59:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right, Christmas. Okay, thanks. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T12:59:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy holidays. Bye now."
    }
  ],
